{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026VQHTrIcwWj1792682449.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>西藏發生7級地震，暫時未有傷亡和損毀報告。</p><p></p><p>西藏那曲市巴青縣，在本港時間晚上大約十時半發生7級地震，震源深度10公里。本港天文台亦錄得這次地震。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:28.281719+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":72,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T14:57:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:15.717711+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:15.717711+00:00","content_hash":"3990abb4aabc806a609098b7a0d7b39c610d84dd058c7514e20b4a3dd26032f8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}